# The build context of enclave/Dockerfile.copilot is the repository root. Only what the image uses is sent to the
# builder (an allowlist): never .secrets/, .git/, contracts/, web/ or node_modules/ (dependencies come from npm ci and
# the lockfiles).
*
!packages/sdk/package.json
!packages/sdk/package-lock.json
!packages/sdk/src/**
!services/copilot/package.json
!services/copilot/package-lock.json
!services/copilot/src/**
!enclave/package.json
!enclave/package-lock.json
!enclave/src/**
!deployments.*.json
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
